      "en": "For all who do such things, all who do unrighteously, are an abomination to the LORD your God.",
      "ko": "무릇 이같이 하는자, 무릇 부정당히 행하는 자는 네 하나님 여호와께 가증하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0ed8d3c9f57515b4c29276f5ca6de9bbb958b9396f8f84a617af2396ec6c6e83",
      "translation_text_hash": "c46aef0faddc6305f0e5bfa0f85c0a73df53d6acff1b9d4ab843956b35f91641",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
